# 通用工具使用方法

## 1. 数据加载器 (data_loaders.py)

### 快速开始 - Per-Patient Z-Score 模式（推荐）

```python
from data_loaders import create_datasets, NormMode

# 一行代码创建数据集
train_ds, test_ds, train_names, test_name = create_datasets(
    data_dir_1d="/path/to/1D/data",
    data_dir_3d="/path/to/3D/data",
    test_subject_idx=38,  # 测试被试编号 (1-based)
    norm_mode=NormMode.PER_PATIENT_ZSCORE
)

# 创建 DataLoader
from torch.utils.data import DataLoader
train_loader = DataLoader(train_ds, batch_size=128, shuffle=True)
test_loader = DataLoader(test_ds, batch_size=128, shuffle=False)
```

### 手动创建数据集

```python
from data_loaders import Brain1D_Dataset, TestDataset, NormMode
from pathlib import Path

# Per-Patient Z-Score 模式
train_files = list(Path("./data/1D").glob("*.mat"))
train_dataset = Brain1D_Dataset(train_files, norm_mode=NormMode.PER_PATIENT_ZSCORE)

test_dataset = TestDataset(
    mat_file_1d=Path("./test_1d.mat"),
    mat_file_3d=Path("./test_3d_validated.mat"),
    norm_mode=NormMode.PER_PATIENT_ZSCORE
)

# Global StandardScaler 模式
train_dataset = Brain1D_Dataset(train_files, norm_mode=NormMode.GLOBAL_SCALER)
test_dataset = TestDataset(
    mat_file_1d, mat_file_3d,
    norm_mode=NormMode.GLOBAL_SCALER,
    scaler=train_dataset.scaler  # 必须传入训练时的scaler
)
```

### 获取标准化配置（用于实验记录）

```python
norm_config = train_dataset.get_norm_config()
# 返回: {"type": "per_patient_zscore", "params": {"epsilon": 1e-8, "fit_scope": "per_patient"}}
```

### 标签一致性验证

```python
is_valid = test_dataset.verify_label_consistency()
# ✅ 标签一致性验证通过：100,000个体素完全匹配
```

