## 3. 指标计算器 (metrics.py)

```python
from metrics import MetricCalculator

# 一次性计算所有标准指标
metrics = MetricCalculator.compute_all(
    y_true=labels,           # (N,) 真实标签
    y_pred_proba=probs,      # (N, C) Softmax概率
    loss_val=loss,           # 可选
    n_classes=102
)

# 返回包含所有 schema 要求指标的字典：
# - gross_accuracy, top1_accuracy, top3_accuracy, top5_accuracy
# - balanced_accuracy, macro_f1, weighted_f1, macro_soft_dice
# - cohen_kappa, nll, ece, brier_score
# - risk_at_95_coverage, actual_coverage_95
```

